# Backoffice UI — pass 1 frozen (+ system-tool tone)

Landing stays frozen separately. Backoffice shares CubeCom identity without marketing composition.

- **Page anatomy / states:** `backoffice-page-grammar.mdc`
- **Pass 2 (`components/bo` + Products reference):** `backoffice-shared-chrome.mdc`

## Governing rule

```text
same tokens + same typography + same controls + same tone system
≠ same density + same composition
```

Backoffice is a **system tool**: maximize useful content per screen, minimize chrome and clicks. Prefer dense tables/lists over card galleries. Primary actions (open product) should be one click from the list.

## Locked

- Instrument Sans via `@repo/fonts`
- Shared CSS tokens — no `--bo-*` / `.bo-btn-primary`
- Compact ops density; flush work surfaces; no Stage heroes
- Auth is a plain form, not a marketing split layout
- Generic UI → `@repo/ui`; ops compositions → `apps/backoffice/components/bo`
- Violet / `--brand` = selected / active / synchronized only

## Do not

- Import landing section spacing / PageHero / Stage into ops surfaces
- Promote Dialog / Sidebar / DataTable to `@repo/ui` unless cross-app
- Rebuild list pages with page-local substitutes for `bo` primitives

